      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "New Zealand is where it all started for Electron - a country with no space heritage. \n\nToday, Rocket Lab is a global space company with teams across the United States, Canada, Europe and New Zealand. \n\nWe're about to launch our 100th rocket.",
