      "text": "Watch our 100th Electron launch LIVE: https://x.com/i/broadcasts/2zkVqoRYKyojyK\n\nLivestream begins Saturday November 14th 04:30 UTC. That's T-1 hour before the launch window opens at 05:30 UTC.",
