      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "All eight Rocket Lab-built Lightning platforms for @MDA_space and @Globalstar have passed initial on-orbit functional tests.\n\nOrbit raising is now underway, with our team supporting the spacecraft as they climb toward their final orbit.",
