      "text": "Rocket Lab’s avionics are up and running on @NASARoman.\n\nOur hardware is enabling Roman's coronagraph instrument, the system that blocks starlight to directly image planets orbiting distant stars.\n\nNext stop: first images!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "NASARoman",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1263147701753044993/27RMFMi7_200x200.jpg",
