          }
        ],
        "name": "Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope",
        "text": "It's the final countdown 🎶\n\nWe're one step closer to Roman's first images! The observatory is now fully functional and the team is performing their final checks and calibrations before starting science observations.\n\nhttps://go.nasa.gov/4A9menV",
